          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.0006056768007131554,
          "sentence": "On the one hand, the paper is very well written and I do think the method is very interesting and promising.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9993943231992869,
            "ai": 0.0005820879163310784,
            "paraphrased": 0.000023588884382076993
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00028938888440048824,
          "sentence": "I'd even like to try it and improve it in the future.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9997106111155996,
            "ai": 0.00027663926945417595,
            "paraphrased": 0.000012749614946312275
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00022282309917095728,
          "sentence": "So, from that point of view a clear accept.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.999777176900829,
            "ai": 0.00021067127177847928,
            "paraphrased": 0.00001215182739247799
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00009981177790521698,
          "sentence": "On the other hand, the paper was using extremely poor baselines, making the authors' method appear sensationally strong in comparison, and over the course of many iterations of reviewer questions and anonymous feedback, this has come down to the authors' methods being far inferior to the state of the art.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999001882220948,
            "ai": 0.00008958346046068896,
            "paraphrased": 0.000010228317444528022
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006459935035163305,
          "sentence": "That's fine (I expected that all along), but the problem is that the authors don't seem to want this to be true...",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999354006496484,
            "ai": 0.000054706616289824086,
            "paraphrased": 0.00000989273406180896
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006698798512155111,
          "sentence": "E.g., they make statements, such as \"We find that both greedy approaches are time-efficient and just a few percents worse than optimality.\"",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999330120148785,
            "ai": 0.00005703964459726636,
            "paraphrased": 0.000009948340524284746
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006197476610253922,
          "sentence": "That statement may be true, but it is very well known in the TSP community that it is typically quite trivial to get to a few percent worse than optimality.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999380252338974,
            "ai": 0.00005215652054776055,
            "paraphrased": 0.000009818245554778666
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006654613934942257,
          "sentence": "What's hard and interesting is to push those last few percent.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999334538606506,
            "ai": 0.00005684650594963123,
            "paraphrased": 0.000009699633399791335
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00003975320353665206,
          "sentence": "(As a side note: the authors probably don't stop LK-H once it has found the optimal solution, like they do with their own method after finding a local optimum.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999602467964633,
            "ai": 0.000029489610976846537,
            "paraphrased": 0.000010263592559805522
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00004208343296507311,
          "sentence": "LK-H is an anytime algorithm, so even if it ran for a day that doesn't mean that it didn't find the optimal solution after milliseconds -- and a solution a few percent suboptimal even faster).",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999579165670349,
            "ai": 0.000031656436395777496,
            "paraphrased": 0.000010426996569295619
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00006870948764565291,
          "sentence": "Nevertheless, since the claims have been toned down over the course of the many iterations, I was starting to feel more positive about this paper when just re-reading it.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999312905123543,
            "ai": 0.00005982997121798823,
            "paraphrased": 0.000008879516427664688
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00011151728874874263,
          "sentence": "That is, until I got to the section on Knapsack solving.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9998884827112513,
            "ai": 0.00010295622549885446,
            "paraphrased": 0.000008561063249888174
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00012836488394253452,
          "sentence": "The version of the paper I reviewed was not bad here, as it at least stated two simple heuristics that yield optimal solutions:",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9998716351160575,
            "ai": 0.00011972363008881143,
            "paraphrased": 0.000008641253853723087
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.01461121025001259,
          "sentence": "\"Two simple heuristics are ExpKnap, which employs brand-and-bound with Linear Programming bounds (Pisinger, 1995), and MinKnap, which employs dynamic programming with enumerative bounds (Pisinger, 1997).",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9853887897499874,
            "ai": 0.014574057043166423,
            "paraphrased": 0.00003715320684616618
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.007062587316252417,
          "sentence": "Exact solutions can also be optained by quantizing the weights to high precisions and then performing dynamic programming with a pseudo-polynomial complexity (Bertsimas & Demir, 2002).\"",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9929374126837476,
            "ai": 0.007021293232523313,
            "paraphrased": 0.000041294083729104225
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00005514705627497163,
          "sentence": "In a revision between December 11 and 14, however, that paragraph, along with the optimal results of ExpKnap and MinKnap seems to have been dropped, and the authors instead introduced two new poor baseline methods (random search and greedy).",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.999944852943725,
            "ai": 0.00004210561078221558,
            "paraphrased": 0.000013041445492756049
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00005343562792875125,
          "sentence": "This was likely in an effort to find some methods that are not optimal on these very easy instances.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999465643720713,
            "ai": 0.0000396803249685928,
            "paraphrased": 0.000013755302960158452
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.000036960937681036006,
          "sentence": "I personally find it pointless to present results for random search here, as nobody would use that for TSP.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.999963039062319,
            "ai": 0.00002260369897106717,
            "paraphrased": 0.000014357238709968836
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00004543257665204087,
          "sentence": "It's like comparing results on MNIST against a decision stump (yes, you'll do better than that, but that is not surprising).",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.999954567423348,
            "ai": 0.000031495706499111136,
            "paraphrased": 0.000013936870152929733
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00004693768695527116,
          "sentence": "The results for greedy are interesting to see.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9999530623130447,
            "ai": 0.000033095771068348406,
            "paraphrased": 0.00001384191588692275
